        <li><a href="/guides/keepsafe-alternative-android-no-account">Keepsafe alternative without an account</a></li>
        <li><a href="/faq">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/Dixonchoi22/Vireault/blob/main/SECURITY.md">Full SECURITY.md (technical)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>
